  "notes": "Seat status from the county's Republican County Committee roster revised Nov 19, 2026 (supersedes the July 15, 2026 revision, whose URL now returns 404). Lawrence elects committee in odd years; current members were elected May 20, 2025, plus appointments shown on the roster. The roster lists two members per precinct without committeeman/committeewoman labels, so seats are labeled 'Member'. A seat printed VACANT is 'empty'; any named member is 'filled'. Pulaski Township 1st District: the roster prints both VACANT entries offset onto the township header line; treated as two empty seats for 1st District. South New Castle Borough, a county precinct, does not appear on the roster at all; its two seats are recorded as 'unknown' (assumed 2 seats like every other precinct). Precinct names are the roster's (ward/district style), e.g. 'NEW CASTLE 1ST WARD 1ST DIST.'."
}
